capalens-ia-check is the simplified, open-source companion of the CapaLens detection engine
(capalens-probe). The action heuristic, the poisoning lexicon and the SKILL.md front-matter
reader are shared with that engine.

The specifications it checks against (Model Context Protocol, OpenAPI, A2A, Agent Skills,
JSON-RPC 2.0, SARIF 2.1.0) are referenced by URL and not redistributed.

The license covers the code, the check catalogue, the lexicon, the demo data and the
documentation in this repository. It grants no rights over the third-party services, documents
or integrations a user chooses to check, nor over any CapaLens data not contained here.
